        "t": "text",
        "v": "A manually created warehousing order has no originating package, so the transaction type is set by hand and the order number comes from the Warehousing number group rather than from a sales or purchase order. For a same-company transfer LN copies the outbound and shipment activities and then the inbound and inspection activities onto this one order, so it carries both sides of the move."
      }
